flowchart LR
    F[Focused viewer only] --> N[One normalization / IME strategy]
    N --> P[Explicit client profile]
    P --> O[Logical key source ownership]
    K[Virtual key palette] --> O
    O --> X[Calibrated Guacamole keysym adapter]
    X --> T[Authorized control tunnel]
    R[Blur / hidden / profile change / end] --> E[Release keys and buttons]
    E --> O
    Z[Transport lost] --> Q[Clear local state + close upstream]
    Q --> S[Fresh reconnect, no replay]
